#: ../libemailfunctions/email.cpp:457
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it contains more than one @. "
"You will not create valid messages if you do not change your address."
msgstr ""
"तपाईँले प्रविष्ट गर्नुभएको इमेल ठेगानामा एक भन्दा बढी@ चिन्ह भएकाले यो अवैध छ । "
"तपाईँले ठेगाना परिवर्तन गर्नुभएन भने वैध सन्देश सिर्जना गर्नुहुने छैन ।"

#: ../libemailfunctions/email.cpp:462
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it does not contain a @.You "
"will not create valid messages if you do not change your address."
msgstr ""
"तपाईँले प्रविष्ट गर्नुभएको इमेल ठेगानामा @ चिन्ह नभएकाले यो अवैध छ । तपाईँले "
"ठेगाना परिवर्तन गर्नुभएन भने वैध सन्देश सिर्जना गर्नु हुनेछैन ।"

#: ../libemailfunctions/email.cpp:467
msgid "You have to enter something in the email address field."
msgstr "तपाईँले इमेल ठेगाना फिल्डमा केही प्रविष्ट गर्नुपर्दछ ।"

#: ../libemailfunctions/email.cpp:469
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it does not contain a local "
"part."
msgstr ""
"तपाईँले प्रविष्ट गर्नुभएको इमेल ठेगानामा स्थानीय भाग नभएकाले यो वैध छैन ।"

#: ../libemailfunctions/email.cpp:472
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it does not contain a domain "
"part."
msgstr ""
"तपाईँले प्रविष्ट गर्नुभएको इमेल ठेगानामा डोमेन भाग नभएकाले यो वैध छैन ।"

#: ../libemailfunctions/email.cpp:475
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it contains unclosed "
"comments/brackets."
msgstr ""
"तपाईँले प्रविष्ट गर्नुभएको इमेल ठेगानामा बन्द नगरिएको टिप्पणी/कोष्ठक भएकाले यो "
"वैध छैन ।"

#: ../libemailfunctions/email.cpp:478
msgid "The email address you entered is valid."
msgstr "तपाईँले प्रविष्ट गर्नुभएको इमेल ठेगाना वैध छ ।"

#: ../libemailfunctions/email.cpp:480
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it contains an unclosed "
"anglebracket."
msgstr ""
"तपाईँले प्रविष्ट गरेको इमेल ठेगानामा बन्द नगरेको एङ्गलब्राकेट भएकाले वैध छैन ।"

#: ../libemailfunctions/email.cpp:483
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it contains an unopened "
"anglebracket."
msgstr ""
"तपाईँले प्रविष्ट गरेको इमेल ठेगानामा बन्द नखोलेको एङ्गलब्राकेट भएकाले वैध छैन ।"

#: ../libemailfunctions/email.cpp:486
msgid ""
"The email address you have entered is not valid because it contains an "
"unexpected comma."
msgstr ""
"तपाईँले प्रविष्ट गर्नुभएको इमेल ठेगानामा अनपेक्षित अल्प विराम भएकाले यो वैध छैन "
"।"

#: ../libemailfunctions/email.cpp:489
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it ended unexpectedly, this "
"probably means you have used an escaping type character like an \\  as the last "
"character in your email address."
msgstr ""
"तपाईँले प्रविष्ट गर्नुभएको इमेल ठेगाना अनपेक्षित रूपमा अन्त्य भएकाले यो वैध "
"छैन, यसको अर्थ तपाईँको इमेल ठेगानामा अन्तिम क्यारेक्टर जस्तै \\ प्रयोग "
"गर्नुभएको हुन सक्छ ।"

#: ../libemailfunctions/email.cpp:494
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it contains quoted text "
"which does not end."
msgstr ""
"तपाईँले प्रविष्ट गर्नुभएको इमेल ठेगानामा अन्त्य नगरिएको उद्वरण पाठ भएकाले यो "
"वैध छैन ।"

#: ../libemailfunctions/email.cpp:497 ../libemailfunctions/email.cpp:558
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it does not seem to contain "
"an actual email address, i.e. something of the form joe@kde.org."
msgstr ""
"तपाईँले प्रविष्ट गर्नुभएको इमेल ठेगाना वैध छैन किनकी यो वास्तविक इमेल ठेगाना "
"समावेश नभएको जस्तो देखिन्छ, जस्तै joe@kde.org ढाँचाको केही ।"

#: ../libemailfunctions/email.cpp:501
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it contains an illegal "
"character."
msgstr ""
"तपाईँले प्रविष्ट गर्नुभएको इमेल ठेगानामा अवैध क्यारेक्टर भएकाले यो वैध छैन ।"

#: ../libemailfunctions/email.cpp:504
msgid ""
"The email address you have entered is not valid because it contains an invalid "
"displayname."
msgstr ""
"तपाईँले प्रविष्ट गर्नुभएको इमेल ठेगानामा अवैध प्रदर्शन नाम रहेकाले यो वैध छैन ।"

#: ../libemailfunctions/email.cpp:507
msgid "Unknown problem with email address"
msgstr "इमेल ठेगानामा अज्ञात समस्या"

